{
  "description": "Detects node configuration drift: BIOS versions, boot order, firmware, fan/thermal health, power draw, UFM fabric alarms and switch firmware. All nodes should match the gold standard — any deviation is highlighted in red.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### On-Demand BMC Refresh\n\nThe Standalone HW Debug stack exporter polls every 10 minutes. To force an immediate re-poll for the selected node, click below — full firmware walk takes ~3 min.\n\n<a href=\"__OBSVM_URL__:9102/refresh?bmc=${node:raw}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;background-color:#3b82f6;color:white;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;\"> Refresh BMC ${node:raw}</a>\n\n*Select a specific node from the dropdown above. \"All\" will not work — pick one BMC IP.*\n"
      }
    },
